# PHASE 7 – PROJECT DOCUMENTATION

## 1. Introduction

The Documentation Phase contains the complete information about the project.

The documentation explains the project from the initial idea to the final result.

## 2. Project Title

Employee Data Import and Management System

## 3. Project Description

The project demonstrates how employee information can be imported from an Excel spreadsheet into a structured ServiceNow table.

## 4. Technologies Used

* ServiceNow
* Microsoft Excel
* Web Browser
* GitHub

